# Cursor AI Rules for UI Component Usage

## 🎯 **Core Principles**
- Always prioritize using existing components from `@ktbiotech/system-design` package
- Maintain consistency across the entire application
- Follow accessibility best practices
- Use semantic HTML and proper component composition

## 📋 **Component Usage Rules**

### **Typography Components**
```tsx
// ✅ ALWAYS use these components instead of raw HTML
import { Typography, Heading, Text, Link, Code, Blockquote, List, ListItem } from '@ktbiotech/system-design';

// ✅ CORRECT usage
<Heading level={1}>Main Title</Heading>
<Heading level={2}>Section Title</Heading>
<Text variant="subtitle">Subtitle</Text>
<Text variant="caption" color="muted">Caption text</Text>
<Link href="/path" external>External Link</Link>
<Code>console.log('code')</Code>

// ❌ NEVER use raw HTML
<h1>Main Title</h1>
<h2>Section Title</h2>
<p>Subtitle</p>
<span>Caption text</span>
<a href="/path">Link</a>
<code>console.log('code')</code>
```

### **Form Components**
```tsx
// ✅ ALWAYS use Form system
import { Form, Input, Select, Button } from '@ktbiotech/system-design';

// ✅ CORRECT usage
<Form onSubmit={handleSubmit} defaultValues={initialData}>
  <Input placeholder="Name" error={errors.name?.message} />
  <Select options={options} placeholder="Select option" />
  <Button type="submit">Submit</Button>
</Form>

// ❌ NEVER use raw form elements
<form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>
  <input type="text" placeholder="Name" />
  <select><option>Select option</option></select>
  <button type="submit">Submit</button>
</form>
```

### **Interactive Components**
```tsx
// ✅ ALWAYS use system components
import { Button, Slider, Step, Table } from '@ktbiotech/system-design';

// ✅ CORRECT usage
<Button variant="primary" size="lg">Action</Button>
<Slider {...SliderPresets.hero}>...</Slider>
<Step items={steps} orientation="vertical" variant="card" />
<Table columns={columns} dataSource={data} pagination={{ pageSize: 10 }} />

// ❌ NEVER use raw elements
<button className="bg-blue-500 text-white px-4 py-2">Action</button>
<div className="slider">...</div>
<ul className="steps">...</ul>
<table>...</table>
```

### **Layout Components**
```tsx
// ✅ ALWAYS use MasterLayout for page structure
import { MasterLayout } from '../components/layout';

// ✅ CORRECT usage
<MasterLayout>
  <Heading level={1}>Page Title</Heading>
  <Text>Page content</Text>
</MasterLayout>

// ❌ NEVER create custom layouts when MasterLayout exists
<div className="min-h-screen">
  <header>...</header>
  <main>...</main>
  <footer>...</footer>
</div>
```

### **Navigation Components**
```tsx
// ✅ ALWAYS use Navbar component
import { Navbar, LanguageSwitcher } from '@ktbiotech/system-design';

// ✅ CORRECT usage
<Navbar 
  logo="logo.png"
  items={navbarItems}
  searchPlaceholder="Search..."
  hotlineNumber="+84 123 456 789"
  hotlineLabel="Hotline"
  address="123 Main St, City"
/>

// ❌ NEVER create custom navigation
<nav className="navbar">...</nav>
```

## 🎨 **Design System Rules**

### **Color Usage**
```tsx
// ✅ ALWAYS use semantic colors
<Typography color="primary">Primary text</Typography>
<Typography color="success">Success message</Typography>
<Typography color="error">Error message</Typography>
<Typography color="warning">Warning message</Typography>
<Typography color="info">Info message</Typography>
<Typography color="muted">Muted text</Typography>

// ❌ NEVER use arbitrary colors
<span className="text-blue-600">Primary text</span>
<span className="text-green-600">Success message</span>
<span className="text-red-600">Error message</span>
```

### **Spacing & Sizing**
```tsx
// ✅ ALWAYS use consistent spacing
<div className="space-y-4">
  <Heading level={2}>Title</Heading>
  <Text>Content</Text>
</div>

// ✅ ALWAYS use responsive sizing
<Heading level={1} className="text-2xl md:text-4xl lg:text-6xl">
  Responsive Title
</Heading>

// ❌ NEVER use inconsistent spacing
<div>
  <h2 className="mb-2">Title</h2>
  <p className="mt-3">Content</p>
</div>

// ❌ NEVER use fixed sizes
<h1 className="text-4xl">Fixed Title</h1>
```

## 🔧 **Component Composition Rules**

### **Rule: Compose, Don't Modify**
```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Compose components
<div className="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
  <Heading level={3} className="mb-4">Card Title</Heading>
  <Text className="mb-4">Card content</Text>
  <Button variant="primary">Action</Button>
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - Modify component internals
<Button className="bg-red-500">Custom Button</Button>
```

### **Rule: Use Presets When Available**
```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Use presets
<Slider {...SliderPresets.hero} />
<Slider {...SliderPresets.productCarousel} />
<Step {...StepPresets.onboarding} />
<Step {...StepPresets.process} />

// ❌ WRONG - Recreate preset functionality
<Slider 
  slidesPerView={1}
  spaceBetween={0}
  loop={true}
  autoplay={{ delay: 5000 }}
  effect="slide"
/>
```

## 📱 **Accessibility Rules**

### **Always Include Accessibility**
```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Accessible components
<Button aria-label="Close dialog">×</Button>
<Input aria-describedby="email-error" />
<Table aria-label="User data table" />
<Link href="/path" aria-label="Navigate to home page">Home</Link>

// ❌ WRONG - Missing accessibility
<button>×</button>
<input />
<table></table>
<a href="/path">Home</a>
```

## 🚀 **Performance Rules**

### **Use Appropriate Components**
```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Use appropriate components
<Text variant="caption">Small text</Text>
<Text size="xs">Extra small text</Text>
<Button size="sm">Small button</Button>

// ❌ WRONG - Over-engineered
<Heading level={6}>Small text</Heading>
<Button size="lg">Small button</Button>
```

## 📋 **Import Patterns**

### **Always Import from System Design**
```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Import from system design
import { 
  Button, 
  Input, 
  Typography, 
  Heading, 
  Text,
  Table,
  Form,
  Slider,
  Step,
  Link,
  Code,
  Blockquote,
  List,
  ListItem,
  Navbar,
  LanguageSwitcher
} from '@ktbiotech/system-design';

// ✅ CORRECT - Import presets
import { SliderPresets, StepPresets } from '@ktbiotech/system-design';

// ❌ WRONG - Import from individual files
import Button from './components/Button';
import Input from './components/Input';
```

## 🚫 **Anti-Patterns to Avoid**

1. **Don't recreate existing components**
2. **Don't use arbitrary CSS classes for styling**
3. **Don't skip accessibility attributes**
4. **Don't use raw HTML when components exist**
5. **Don't modify component internals**
6. **Don't ignore responsive design**
7. **Don't use inconsistent spacing/sizing**
8. **Don't create custom layouts when MasterLayout exists**
9. **Don't use hardcoded colors when semantic colors exist**
10. **Don't skip form validation and error handling**

## 🎯 **Quick Reference Patterns**

### **Page Layout Pattern**
```tsx
import { MasterLayout } from '../components/layout';
import { Heading, Text } from '@ktbiotech/system-design';

export default function Page() {
  return (
    <MasterLayout>
      <Heading level={1}>Page Title</Heading>
      <Text variant="subtitle" className="mb-8">
        Page description
      </Text>
      {/* Page content */}
    </MasterLayout>
  );
}
```

### **Form Pattern**
```tsx
import { Form, Input, Select, Button } from '@ktbiotech/system-design';

export default function ContactForm() {
  return (
    <Form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>
      <div className="space-y-6">
        <Input placeholder="Name" />
        <Input type="email" placeholder="Email" />
        <Select options={countryOptions} placeholder="Country" />
        <Button type="submit">Submit</Button>
      </div>
    </Form>
  );
}
```

### **Data Display Pattern**
```tsx
import { Table } from '@ktbiotech/system-design';

export default function DataTable() {
  return (
    <Table 
      columns={columns}
      dataSource={data}
      pagination={{ pageSize: 10 }}
      selectable={true}
      onRowClick={handleRowClick}
    />
  );
}
```

## 🔍 **Code Review Checklist**

Before submitting any code, ensure:
- [ ] Used system design components instead of raw HTML
- [ ] Applied consistent typography hierarchy
- [ ] Used semantic colors and spacing
- [ ] Included proper accessibility attributes
- [ ] Used presets when available
- [ ] Followed responsive design patterns
- [ ] No custom CSS that duplicates component functionality
- [ ] Proper import statements from `@ktbiotech/system-design`
- [ ] Used MasterLayout for page structure
- [ ] Form validation and error handling included

## 🎨 **Component Hierarchy**

```
@ktbiotech/system-design
├── Typography (Base)
│   ├── Heading (H1-H6)
│   ├── Text (sizes, variants)
│   ├── Link (internal/external)
│   ├── Code (inline)
│   ├── Blockquote
│   └── List/ListItem
├── Form Components
│   ├── Form (with validation)
│   ├── Input
│   └── Select
├── Interactive Components
│   ├── Button
│   ├── Slider (with presets)
│   ├── Step (with presets)
│   └── Table
├── Navigation Components
│   ├── Navbar (with search, hotline, address)
│   └── LanguageSwitcher
└── Layout Components
    └── MasterLayout
```

---

**Remember**: The goal is to maintain consistency, improve development speed, and ensure accessibility across the entire application by leveraging our design system components. Always check if a component exists before creating a new one.
